1 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 years, more than any other pair, and in 2025 it came in at just 38% of normal. This year has run wetter so far, with March to April 2026 at 189% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 23242 had its driest year in 1953 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
